 "note": {
  "status": "draft",
  "text": "Class 4: third-party accounts, people and organisations the business deals with on credit:\n• 40 suppliers (401 suppliers of goods), 41 customers (411), 42 staff (422 salaries due), 43 social security (CNPS in Cameroon), 44 the State (taxes, VAT), 47 other debtors and creditors.\nClass 5: treasury accounts, money available at once:\n• 52 banks (521), 53 financial institutions (post office), 55 electronic money (mobile money), 57 cash in hand (571).\nClass 6: expenses of ordinary activities:\n• 60 purchases (601 purchases of goods, 605 other purchases: water, electricity), 61 transport, 62 and 63 external services (rent, repairs, insurance, advertising), 64 taxes, 65 other expenses, 66 staff expenses (661 salaries), 67 financial expenses (interest), 68 depreciation.",
  "checks": []
 },
 "worked_example": {
